# ER-Magellan benchmark pairs are .txt and MUST be tracked. Without this
# negation the `*.txt` rules above silently swallow all 41,519 human-labelled
# pairs, `git add` reports nothing, and training fails on the remote with
# "No datasets found".
!data/er_magellan/**/*.txt



